{"seq":5,"slug":"functional-programming","title":"函数式编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/h/languages/functional-programming","rating":{"composite":4.01,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.11,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 函数式编程 简介\n\n函数式编程（Functional Programming，简称 FP）是一种以**纯函数**和**不可变数据**为核心的编程范式。它源自 λ 演算的数学基础，强调通过函数组合而非状态变更来构建程序。从 Haskell 到 TypeScript，从 Rust 到 Scala，函数式思想正深刻影响着现代编程语言的设计与工程实践。\n\n本知识库面向希望系统掌握函数式编程理论与实践的开发者。无论你是正在用 TypeScript 编写前端应用、用 Rust 构建系统级程序，还是想深入理解 Haskell 中的类型系统与抽象，这里都将为你提供从基础概念到工程落地的完整知识体系。\n\n全书共分五个章节：\n\n第一章**核心概念**从纯函数与不可变性出发，解析一等函数、递归与尾调用优化、引用透明性等函数式编程的基石。\n\n第二章**组合模式**聚焦函数组合、柯里化与偏应用、Point-free 风格以及管道与链式调用，帮助你掌握将小函数组装为复杂逻辑的核心技巧。\n\n第三章**代数类型**深入和类型与积类型、Option 与 Result、模式匹配以及可辨识联合，建立类型驱动设计的思维方式。\n\n第四章**函子与单子**从 Functor 与 map 入手，逐步推进到 Monad 基础、常见 Monad 实例和 Monad Transformer，揭示函数式抽象的核心机制。\n\n第五章**FP 实战**围绕 TypeScript 与 Rust 中的函数式实践展开，涵盖状态管理和基于属性的测试，将理论转化为可落地的工程方案。\n\n建议按章节顺序学习。前两章建立基础思维模型，第三四章深入类型系统与抽象层次，第五章将所有知识融合为实战能力。如果你已有函数式基础，可直接跳到第三章或第五章。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"core-concepts","title":"核心概念","docCount":4,"url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/core-concepts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pure-functions-and-immutability","title":"纯函数与不可变性","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/core-concepts/pure-functions-and-immutability"},{"seq":2,"slug":"first-class-functions","title":"一等函数","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/core-concepts/first-class-functions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"recursion-and-tail-call","title":"递归与尾调用","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/core-concepts/recursion-and-tail-call"},{"seq":4,"slug":"referential-transparency","title":"引用透明性","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/core-concepts/referential-transparency"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"composition-patterns","title":"组合模式","docCount":4,"url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/composition-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"function-composition","title":"函数组合","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/composition-patterns/function-composition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"currying-and-partial","title":"柯里化与偏应用","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/composition-patterns/currying-and-partial"},{"seq":3,"slug":"point-free-style","title":"Point-free 风格","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/composition-patterns/point-free-style"},{"seq":4,"slug":"pipeline-and-chaining","title":"管道与链式调用","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/composition-patterns/pipeline-and-chaining"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"algebraic-types","title":"代数类型","docCount":4,"url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/algebraic-types","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sum-and-product-types","title":"和类型与积类型","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/algebraic-types/sum-and-product-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"option-and-result","title":"Option 与 Result","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/algebraic-types/option-and-result"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pattern-matching","title":"模式匹配","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/algebraic-types/pattern-matching"},{"seq":4,"slug":"discriminated-unions","title":"可辨识联合","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/algebraic-types/discriminated-unions"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"functors-and-monads","title":"函子与单子","docCount":4,"url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"functor-and-map","title":"函子与 map","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads/functor-and-map"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monad-fundamentals","title":"Monad 基础","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads/monad-fundamentals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"common-monads","title":"常见 Monad","url":"/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads/common-monads"},{"seq":4,"slug":"monad-transformers","title":"Monad Transformer 单子变换器","url":"/h/languages/functional-program